    "animation": null
  },
  "characterDescription": "A cinematic, fixed-position navigation with a gradient fade-to-transparent background that dissolves into the page content — designed for full-bleed video or image hero sections. The all-caps, tight-tracked typography and opacity-based scroll hiding signal a dark, immersive experience where the nav recedes rather than dominates."
